A||||7||sjp777||She's still got it.||||10||
Z||000000||sjp777||06-23-2001||09:55 PM||||Went to the local pontiac dealer today to pick up a part. I come out and there are 3 salesmen standing around my car. I walk up and they're just marveling about it. They asked me to pop the decklid, let them look in the interior, and just loved the wheels.<P>Then they asked me to wait while they ran in to get another salesman who had his own 88 formula that he thought was the cleanest fiero in town.<P>He came out and about sh!t. He was asking where I got all the aftermarket stuff. He had no idea about this forum or that sites like the fiero store existed. He was getting all his parts through the dealer and paying through the nose, even with his discount.<P>He totally wanted my scoop and wanted to know where I got it. I told him I made it myself and he asked me to make him one. I told him it's a lot of labor, but only about $10 for parts. He offered me $100 to make him one.<P>I said sold.<P>She's 13 years old, but still turns heads wherever she goes.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_4.jpg">    <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A><P><p>[This message has been edited by sjp777 (edited 06-23-2001).]||||reg||10
